+        <h3>French Press</h3>
+        <p>Add 30g of coarse coffee to the press and pour in 500g of hot water. Stir gently, place the lid on
+          top, and let it steep for four minutes. Break the crust, skim off the foam, then press slowly and
+          serve immediately so it doesn't over-extract.</p>
+      </div>
+      <div class="text-block">
+        <h3>Espresso</h3>
+        <p>Dose 18g of finely ground coffee, distribute evenly, and tamp level. Pull the shot to roughly 36g in
+          the cup over 25–30 seconds. Dial in by adjusting your grind one step at a time and tasting as you go.
+        </p>
+      </div>
